&#39;s Test&#39;, when both nitrogen and sulphur are present in an organic compound, sodium thiocyanate is formed.</p><p>Statement II : If both nitrogen and sulphur are present in an organic compound, then the excess of sodium used in sodium fusion will decompose the sodium thiocyanate formed to give <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>NaCN</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Na</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></math>.</p><p>In the light of the above statements, choose the most appropriate answer from the options a: given below</p>"}, "options": [{"id": "3fabd1", "text": "Both Statement I and Statement II are correct.", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f74c677dc36a892237e"}, {"id": "ef37ff", "text": "Both Statement I and Statement II are incorrect.", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f74c677dc36a892237f"}, {"id": "1bdb95", "text": "Statement I is correct but Statement II is incorrect.", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f74c677dc36a8922380"}, {"id": "f69fe0", "text": "Statement I is incorrect but Statement II is correct.", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f74c677dc36a8922381"}], "questionLabels": []}, {"_id": "69de4f74c677dc36a8922382", "type": "singleCorrect", "chapters": ["60ced3330e34b73944ddfaf4"], "topics": ["60e40fd6f1ef260f84ed1ea1"], "concepts": ["60e567dd499d1e49588f9cbe"], "question": {"text": "The increasing order of basicity for the following intermediates is (from weak to strong)<br /><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/quantrexacademy-app.firebasestorage.app/o/questions%2Ffigs%2Fpyq%2Fjee_main%2F31affb72-1756-4e55-b56e-e3c784532d21-image.png?alt=media\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 239px;\" />"}, "options": [{"id": "63f6ed", "text": "<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&lt;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&lt;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&lt;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&lt;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f74c677dc36a8922383"}, {"id": "a04766", "text": "<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&lt;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&lt;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&lt;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&lt;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f74c677dc36a8922384"}, {"id": "5f78a0", "text": "<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&lt;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&lt;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&lt;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&lt;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f74c677dc36a8922385"}, {"id": "839817", "text": "<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced><